<title>UK: Norwich Union shareholders approve float.</title>
<headline>Norwich Union shareholders approve float.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Members of the Norwich Union, Britain's third-largest life insurer, on Friday voted overwhelmingly in favour of plans to float on the London Stock Exchange on Friday.</p>
<p>Results of postal voting showed a 98.9 percent majority in favour of the scheme. The official result will not be announced until next Tuesday after votes at an extraordinary general meeting, where around 200 members attended, are included.</p>
</text>
